  "description": "Brunhild Wotan's wildest dream is to serve with Captain Sigmund Volsungr in the first order. Though he soon finds that it isn't always wise to meet one's heroes, he remains determined and throws himself into his journey as a knight, completely dedicated to the order and his captain. Romantic schemes and misunderstandings abound, finally bringing the sunny Sir Wotan and grumpy Captain Volsungr closer together and closer to realizing their true feelings.\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
